+/**
+ * RULING-6 PROTOTYPE: in the frame moving with the wave (c along the ray) the surface is a streamline and
+ * q² = q_c² + 2 g (y_top − y_surface), q_c = (1 − B) c at the crest; the lab flow is c r̂ + q t̂, t̂ = (−n_y, n_a) (back
+ * over the crest, up the face, forward along a roof): along = c − q n_y, up = q n_a.
